    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 31,
      "title": {
        "en": "Neat haircuts and quality trims"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many clients praise the salon for stylish coat trims, thorough bathing, and tidy breed-specific haircuts. However, several owners experienced minor grooming issues, such as nicked claws or uneven scissoring, while the vast majority report handsome results that leave pets looking their best."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 29,
      "title": {
        "en": "Affectionate care with occasional concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners describe a welcoming environment where groomers pamper dogs with treats and colourful bandanas. Nevertheless, a small number of reviewers raised concerns regarding rough handling or agitation during nail clippings, showing that experiences may vary depending on the groomer."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 22,
      "title": {
        "en": "Helpful and accommodating salon team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents highlight the friendly customer service provided by the salon owner, Richard, and his grooming team. Reviewers frequently note that staff members listen to styling requests, communicate politely upon drop-off, and accommodate short-notice grooming requests without complaint."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Trendy Pets Grooming Salon accept walk-in clients?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, several clients mention dropping off their dogs for nail trimming or basic grooming without prior appointments."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How do clients perceive the grooming prices?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers consistently describe the pricing as reasonable and competitive compared with other grooming salons in the area."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What should owners communicate when dropping off their dogs?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Clients recommend specifying exact coat length preferences and checking paws carefully after nail trims."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are decorative accessories included with grooming?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently mention that pets receive colourful neck decorations or bandanas following a full groom."
